WEBVTT

01:42.000 --> 01:44.150
I now declare Decision 32

01:44.150 --> 01:45.430
COM 8B.23

01:45.430 --> 01:46.759
adopted as amended.

01:46.920 --> 01:48.280
Congratulations, China.

01:48.640 --> 01:50.070
When a river comes to life,

01:50.509 --> 01:51.710
a piece of history

01:51.710 --> 01:54.039
gets a chance to flow against the tide.

01:54.750 --> 01:57.400
The ancient canal that has flowed for thousands of years,

01:57.680 --> 01:59.280
in a new millennium,

01:59.430 --> 02:03.430
has once again burst forth with unstoppable new vitality.

02:04.310 --> 02:07.350
This era has given it a new appearance.

02:08.080 --> 02:09.800
The Grand Canal

02:10.190 --> 02:12.800
once again proves to all who gaze upon it with anticipation

02:13.430 --> 02:15.470
its indomitable

02:15.680 --> 02:17.360
and pioneering spirit.

02:17.960 --> 02:20.520
Canal connections, canal people.

02:21.000 --> 02:24.150
Canal families, canal children.

02:24.800 --> 02:26.590
The canal's brand-new pulse

02:27.120 --> 02:29.710
is inspiring everyone who loves it

02:29.710 --> 02:32.030
and those it loves.

02:32.950 --> 02:35.560
Their fate and the canal's rebirth

02:35.840 --> 02:39.079
are closely intertwined, complementing each other.

02:39.079 --> 02:41.000
Folks of Flower Street,

02:41.590 --> 02:43.630
citizens of Honghuai City,

02:43.750 --> 02:44.480
good afternoon!

02:44.480 --> 02:45.630
Good afternoon!

02:46.840 --> 02:50.190
Now, let's have Mayor Gu speak to us.

02:50.280 --> 02:51.120
Great!

02:53.840 --> 02:55.870
Hello, fellow citizens and friends.

02:55.870 --> 02:56.960
Hello!

02:58.280 --> 03:00.800
To celebrate the Grand Canal becoming a World Heritage Site,

03:01.000 --> 03:02.310
the government

03:02.400 --> 03:05.000
will organize festivities that last for a week.

03:05.030 --> 03:06.760
We welcome everyone to participate in them

03:06.840 --> 03:09.750
to celebrate the rebirth of the Grand Canal!

03:09.750 --> 03:10.800
Great!

03:12.840 --> 03:13.840
In addition,

03:14.030 --> 03:15.910
the renovation of Flower Street

03:16.030 --> 03:18.280
will enter a new phase.

03:18.390 --> 03:19.150
When it's done,

03:19.190 --> 03:22.030
we'll see a brand new Honghuai!

03:22.030 --> 03:23.079
Great!

03:31.190 --> 03:32.310
Great!

03:34.400 --> 03:36.000
Come on.

03:37.270 --> 03:38.840
Try this. It's quite delicious.

03:38.840 --> 03:39.680
Mayor Gu,

03:40.190 --> 03:41.840
Mr. Zhou just said

03:41.910 --> 03:43.079
becoming a World Heritage Site

03:43.280 --> 03:45.840
will greatly boost Flower Street's economy.

03:46.030 --> 03:47.150
Being a World Heritage Site

03:47.470 --> 03:49.280
doesn't just bring benefits to Honghuai

03:49.360 --> 03:50.590
and Flower Street.

03:50.840 --> 03:52.400
It also brings responsibility.

03:52.560 --> 03:54.400
The Grand Canal has been flowing for over 2,000 years.

03:54.430 --> 03:56.190
It's the mother river for all of us.

03:56.520 --> 03:59.000
Each of us has the responsibility

03:59.000 --> 04:00.870
to protect and revitalize it.

04:01.430 --> 04:02.240
Yes.

04:03.120 --> 04:03.870
It wasn't easy.

04:03.870 --> 04:05.000
We waited for so many years.

04:05.120 --> 04:06.590
There was no news a couple of days ago,

04:06.590 --> 04:07.840
and I thought we failed.

04:09.400 --> 04:10.120
How could that be?

04:10.120 --> 04:11.560
Good things are worth waiting for.

04:12.000 --> 04:13.150
The construction of the Grand Canal

04:13.520 --> 04:14.840
began during the Spring and Autumn period

04:15.710 --> 04:16.680
and didn't end until modern times.

04:17.360 --> 04:19.269
Countless people worked tirelessly

04:19.269 --> 04:20.510
for over 2,000 years.

04:21.720 --> 04:22.800
It took over 2,000 years

04:23.120 --> 04:24.600
for it to finally take shape.

04:25.270 --> 04:26.830
In the history of human civilization,

04:26.830 --> 04:28.950
it's the largest-scale hydraulic project,

04:29.600 --> 04:31.070
bar none.

04:31.120 --> 04:31.750
Yes.

04:32.159 --> 04:33.190
L-Let's have a toast

04:33.190 --> 04:34.830
to our great mother river.

04:34.830 --> 04:35.870
Come on.

04:35.870 --> 04:36.600
Cheers.

04:36.680 --> 04:37.120
Cheers.

04:41.680 --> 04:42.830
While everyone is here,

04:43.120 --> 04:44.230
there's something I'd like to say.

04:45.680 --> 04:47.870
I'm thinking of taking advantage of this success

04:47.870 --> 04:50.560
to revitalize Honghuai City and Flower Street.

04:50.560 --> 04:52.720
Now, the most crucial thing is people,

04:53.120 --> 04:54.440
especially young people.

04:54.880 --> 04:56.480
As we all know,

04:56.560 --> 04:58.830
our young generations, after growing up,

04:58.830 --> 05:00.920
have gradually left their homes

05:00.950 --> 05:02.270
to start businesses elsewhere.

05:02.270 --> 05:03.270
Now, the government

05:03.270 --> 05:05.120
has formulated corresponding policies

05:05.390 --> 05:07.270
in the hope of attracting

05:07.270 --> 05:10.120
young people back to start businesses in small towns.

05:10.120 --> 05:12.510
As far as I know, all your children are away from home.

05:12.870 --> 05:14.390
I hope you parents

05:14.390 --> 05:16.120
can spread the word about our policies.

05:16.680 --> 05:18.680
We'd like to have them back

05:18.680 --> 05:20.160
to restore our glory.

05:20.720 --> 05:21.720
Great!

05:21.950 --> 05:22.870
Mayor Gu,

05:22.870 --> 05:24.360
I'll be the first to respond to your call.

05:24.600 --> 05:26.680
Later, I'll ask my son to come back.

05:26.680 --> 05:28.160
Chen Bo's son has been

05:28.480 --> 05:29.750
staying in Honghuai all along.

05:30.390 --> 05:31.560
We'll call them immediately

05:31.560 --> 05:33.000
and force them to come back if necessary,

05:33.120 --> 05:34.480
telling them not to go anywhere else

05:34.480 --> 05:36.270
and just stay on Flower Street, right?

05:36.270 --> 05:37.070
Yes, yes.

05:37.120 --> 05:38.240
That's not necessary.

05:38.830 --> 05:40.510
As their parents, you just need

05:40.560 --> 05:42.159
to inform them about the policies.

05:42.159 --> 05:43.360
If they're willing to come back,

05:43.400 --> 05:44.360
we certainly welcome them.

05:44.830 --> 05:46.680
But if they have any opinions or suggestions

05:46.680 --> 05:48.870
about our policies,

05:48.870 --> 05:50.830
they can come to me and talk with me directly.

05:50.830 --> 05:52.480
We're willing to make changes.

05:53.360 --> 05:54.590
I hope

05:54.590 --> 05:56.040
those children will come back

05:56.120 --> 05:57.800
not because their parents force them to,

05:58.360 --> 06:00.270
but because they're attracted by the bright future

06:00.360 --> 06:01.600
of Flower Street.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.040
Only in this way

06:03.390 --> 06:05.480
will they have the enthusiasm and motivation

06:05.600 --> 06:07.720
to make Flower Street better.

06:07.720 --> 06:08.510
Great. That's right.

06:08.680 --> 06:09.920
Mayor Gu makes a great point.

06:10.270 --> 06:11.280
Anyway, no matter what,

06:12.070 --> 06:14.800
today I've truly felt that

06:14.800 --> 06:15.830
the Grand Canal

06:16.360 --> 06:17.270
is a miracle.

06:18.120 --> 06:19.840
We should all take pride in it.

06:19.840 --> 06:22.070
Then let's have another toast to this miracle.

06:22.240 --> 06:23.800
Come on.

06:23.800 --> 06:24.800
Cheers.

06:24.800 --> 06:26.000
To our pride.

06:26.160 --> 06:26.480
To our pride.

06:26.480 --> 06:27.680
To our pride.

06:30.040 --> 06:32.350
In the past, when Boss Xie and I were seafarers,

06:32.680 --> 06:33.800
we sailed all the way north.

06:34.240 --> 06:37.120
At that time, the places close to the river

06:37.480 --> 06:38.480
had many tall buildings,

06:38.600 --> 06:39.680
and business was booming,

06:39.680 --> 06:40.909
while the places far from the river

06:41.480 --> 06:42.800
were not as good, right, Boss Xie?

06:42.800 --> 06:44.040
Yes, exactly.

06:44.159 --> 06:44.760
That's right.

06:44.800 --> 06:46.040
In our country,

06:46.390 --> 06:47.920
the canal still plays a crucial role

06:48.000 --> 06:48.920
in commerce.

06:49.240 --> 06:50.630
The canal connects the north and south,

06:50.720 --> 06:51.600
benefiting the entire nation.

06:52.040 --> 06:52.680
Although these years...

06:52.680 --> 06:53.680
Haihong, what's wrong?

06:53.720 --> 06:54.800
You're upset?

06:54.920 --> 06:56.430
In terms of cargo capacity…

06:56.480 --> 06:57.240
No.

06:57.270 --> 06:59.120
The canal still plays the most important role.

06:59.159 --> 07:00.430
I just feel that

07:00.830 --> 07:03.040
at such a joyous moment,

07:03.640 --> 07:05.310
if all our children were here with us,

07:05.720 --> 07:06.720
it would be wonderful.

07:10.040 --> 07:11.240
Then ask them to come back.

07:12.120 --> 07:12.480
Let's eat.

07:12.600 --> 07:14.160
Cheers!

07:20.830 --> 07:21.560
Happy.

07:21.920 --> 07:22.920
I'm so happy.

07:23.360 --> 07:25.120
I feel like singing right now

07:25.390 --> 07:26.830
to praise the Grand Canal.

07:27.800 --> 07:29.120
Too bad there's not a suitable song.

07:29.160 --> 07:30.360
There is.

07:30.360 --> 07:31.080
Here it goes.

07:32.680 --> 07:36.600
The great river…

07:37.390 --> 07:38.800
That's about the Yangtze River,

07:38.800 --> 07:39.870
not the canal.

07:40.159 --> 07:42.070
The Yangtze River and the canal are connected.

07:42.070 --> 07:43.720
We all grew up by the water.

07:43.720 --> 07:45.560
Anywhere near the water is our home.

07:48.640 --> 07:50.240
Why that face? Am I wrong?

07:54.040 --> 07:56.070
You're right. I just didn't expect

07:56.070 --> 07:57.950
you to say something so philosophical.

08:00.950 --> 08:01.630
Fenghua!

08:05.560 --> 08:07.800
Since everyone's here today,

08:07.800 --> 08:10.590
I suggest we go home together for the Mid-Autumn Festival.

08:10.630 --> 08:11.630
I agree!

08:11.870 --> 08:12.630
Well,

08:13.310 --> 08:14.600
I didn't go back last Mid-Autumn Festival.

08:14.630 --> 08:16.000
My mom nagged me for ages about it.

08:16.630 --> 08:17.680
Can we get time off?

08:22.430 --> 08:23.510
Why are you looking at me?

08:23.750 --> 08:26.270
Aren't you your boss's favorite? Like the historical figure He Shen.

08:26.310 --> 08:27.240
Your words should carry weight.

08:27.360 --> 08:28.270
He Shen?

08:29.240 --> 08:31.510
I-I didn't say that. Y-You're

08:31.510 --> 08:33.120
more like Li Hongzhang in the company.

08:33.120 --> 08:34.360
Is that a compliment or an insult?

08:34.440 --> 08:35.240
A compliment!

08:35.630 --> 08:37.750
Minister Li was a renowned statesman of his time.

08:37.750 --> 08:39.750
He contributed greatly to prolonging the Qing dynasty.

08:39.750 --> 08:40.440
Knock it off.

08:42.630 --> 08:43.720
Alright, I'll ask about it.

08:44.320 --> 08:46.480
If it works with the schedule, we'll go back together.

08:46.870 --> 08:48.120
Great, Minister Xie!

08:48.550 --> 08:49.790
Here, try this.

08:49.790 --> 08:51.360
I don't want this. I want fish.

08:51.360 --> 08:52.320
Okay, fish it is.

08:53.750 --> 08:54.910
Please.

08:56.960 --> 08:57.750
Fill my glass.

08:59.600 --> 09:00.910
Alright. I'll do it myself.

09:01.360 --> 09:01.870
Cheers!

09:01.910 --> 09:02.390
Cheers.

09:04.120 --> 09:04.840
Xingchi.

09:05.670 --> 09:06.390
Cheers.

09:07.670 --> 09:08.360
Cheers!

09:08.910 --> 09:10.120
Cheers.

09:12.030 --> 09:12.960
I'm leaving.

09:13.000 --> 09:13.440
Take care.

09:13.440 --> 09:14.510
Don't stay out late. Bye-bye.

09:14.510 --> 09:15.390
Let me know when you're home.

09:16.600 --> 09:17.390
Bye-bye.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.910
I'm heading off too.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.480
I'll walk home. See you tomorrow.

09:21.790 --> 09:22.390
Watch out for cars.

09:22.390 --> 09:23.550
Be careful.

09:26.110 --> 09:27.600
Let's go. You can stay over at my place tonight.

09:30.120 --> 09:31.030
You want to drink more?

09:33.670 --> 09:34.480
Wanghe,

09:34.910 --> 09:36.200
what do you think of my abilities?

09:37.360 --> 09:38.080
In what aspect?

09:38.480 --> 09:39.150
Management.

09:41.150 --> 09:42.360
I didn't have experience before,

09:42.910 --> 09:45.030
but after running around for a while recently,

09:45.120 --> 09:47.390
I think I'm ready.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.360
Well,

09:50.030 --> 09:52.030
I want to apply for a station

09:52.790 --> 09:53.630
with me as the chief.

09:55.120 --> 09:55.840
Bro,

09:56.670 --> 09:58.360
you've never managed a station before.

10:00.150 --> 10:01.480
Food delivery is a new industry.

10:02.360 --> 10:04.480
Every station chief starts from scratch.

10:06.270 --> 10:07.480
I'm ready, Wanghe.

10:08.150 --> 10:09.030
Trust me.

10:10.000 --> 10:12.510
I'll work hard. I won't embarrass you.

10:14.600 --> 10:16.200
I hate to discourage you…

10:16.200 --> 10:17.720
Then don't.

10:17.840 --> 10:19.550
I've never asked you for anything in my life.

10:20.630 --> 10:22.080
I've thought it through this time.

10:23.600 --> 10:26.360
Instead of wasting my life away,

10:26.510 --> 10:27.270
I want

10:27.720 --> 10:29.200
to give it my all

10:29.480 --> 10:30.790
when I'm still young.

10:33.120 --> 10:34.550
I'm done living in the basement.

10:37.600 --> 10:38.750
I just hope

10:40.320 --> 10:43.200
my life can get a little better every day.

10:44.600 --> 10:45.600
I don't want a drastic change.

10:46.200 --> 10:47.480
Just a little better is enough.

10:49.760 --> 10:51.120
You like her that much?

10:56.960 --> 10:58.120
So do you.

11:01.870 --> 11:03.080
Cut the crap.

11:04.440 --> 11:06.000
Let's do our best and see

11:08.240 --> 11:09.750
who saves up enough to marry her first.

11:17.720 --> 11:18.480
Alright.

11:19.600 --> 11:20.670
I accept

11:22.120 --> 11:24.110
your challenge. Good luck to you,

11:25.120 --> 11:26.000
and good luck to me.

11:28.480 --> 11:29.270
Good luck to you.

11:35.320 --> 11:36.080
Chief?

11:36.600 --> 11:37.910
Xingchi isn't experienced enough,

11:38.840 --> 11:40.910
but I believe he's capable enough.

11:44.000 --> 11:45.360
If he fails at it,

11:45.360 --> 11:46.510
you'll be affected.

11:47.000 --> 11:49.360
Those in Haidian are waiting to laugh at you.

11:50.240 --> 11:51.480
If he fails,

11:51.720 --> 11:52.720
I'll take full responsibility.

11:53.720 --> 11:54.840
How?

11:55.240 --> 11:56.240
I have stock options.

11:56.710 --> 11:58.080
If Xingchi fails,

11:58.480 --> 11:59.680
just calculate the losses

12:00.000 --> 12:01.480
and deduct them from my options.

12:06.960 --> 12:08.840
Let me tell you, whether a system is strong or not

12:08.840 --> 12:10.510
all comes down to the order rejection rate.

12:10.670 --> 12:11.670
Take Yuntu, for example.

12:11.670 --> 12:13.670
If the number of rejected orders gets too high in one day,

12:13.670 --> 12:14.440
the system will automatically...

12:14.440 --> 12:15.200
Xingchi.

12:15.440 --> 12:16.200
That won't do.

12:16.790 --> 12:17.440
Take it.

12:20.120 --> 12:20.750
Wanghe.

12:22.320 --> 12:23.320
The boss agreed.

12:27.080 --> 12:27.840
I owe you big time.

12:27.840 --> 12:29.000
Alright, knock it off.

12:30.120 --> 12:30.840
Just work hard.

12:31.320 --> 12:32.510
But don't put too much pressure on yourself.

12:32.750 --> 12:33.590
There will definitely

12:34.080 --> 12:35.840
be gossip in the company.

12:36.120 --> 12:37.550
Don't take it to heart.

12:38.080 --> 12:40.320
From now on, you need to use your actions

12:40.600 --> 12:41.960
to prove them wrong.

12:42.750 --> 12:43.600
Don't worry.

12:43.840 --> 12:44.670
They'll know they're dead wrong!

12:49.360 --> 12:50.120
Guys,

12:50.750 --> 12:51.960
from today on,

12:52.240 --> 12:54.000
we sink or swim together.

12:54.600 --> 12:55.200
I don't know

12:55.480 --> 12:56.720
how things are in other stations.

12:57.080 --> 12:58.870
But here, the most important thing

12:59.120 --> 12:59.630
is fairness.

12:59.720 --> 13:00.480
Great!

13:03.000 --> 13:03.750
Clap.

13:06.360 --> 13:07.120
At our station, I will

13:07.120 --> 13:09.270
do my best to distribute orders fairly.

13:09.480 --> 13:11.270
I won't make you take orders from over three kilometers away.

13:12.720 --> 13:14.080
When something unexpected happens,

13:14.080 --> 13:14.840
don't panic, stay calm,

13:14.840 --> 13:15.750
and call the station.

13:16.000 --> 13:16.750
I'll handle it.

13:16.950 --> 13:18.870
If there's a dispute with a customer,

13:19.240 --> 13:20.600
don't panic either.

13:20.750 --> 13:21.870
Calm down

13:22.000 --> 13:23.960
and handle it according to the customer manual.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.320
If you can't handle it,

13:25.390 --> 13:26.120
leave it to me.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.840
I won't let anyone take the blame.

13:28.080 --> 13:31.320
Great!

13:31.870 --> 13:33.150
Alright.

13:33.870 --> 13:35.120
Don't get excited yet.

13:35.510 --> 13:36.630
What if I'm fooling you all?

13:37.240 --> 13:37.720
Right?

13:38.240 --> 13:39.120
We're out here hustling

13:39.240 --> 13:41.240
just to make our next meal a bit better.

13:42.750 --> 13:44.240
Whether you're truly capable or not,

13:44.320 --> 13:45.630
we'll find out after you're put to the test.

13:46.000 --> 13:47.150
That's all I have to say.

13:47.630 --> 13:48.720
Let's get rich!

13:49.080 --> 13:49.630
Roll out!

13:49.870 --> 13:50.870
Yes.

13:50.870 --> 13:51.720
Roll out!

13:51.750 --> 13:52.600
Stay safe.

13:52.840 --> 13:53.720
Everyone, stay safe.

13:54.480 --> 13:55.240
Let's go.

13:55.320 --> 13:56.200
Let's go.

13:56.600 --> 13:57.150
Wang Yuan.

13:59.240 --> 13:59.870
You

14:00.200 --> 14:01.360
are always the loudest one.

14:02.240 --> 14:03.200
Listen.

14:03.360 --> 14:05.510
I only have one request for you.

14:05.750 --> 14:06.790
Don't get into fights.

14:06.960 --> 14:07.870
Don't worry.

14:07.990 --> 14:09.240
I'll just argue and won't get physical.

14:09.630 --> 14:10.750
You can't argue either.

14:10.870 --> 14:12.200
Just listen to whatever the client says.

14:12.600 --> 14:13.870
If you can't resolve it, hand it over to me.

14:15.720 --> 14:16.480
I'm off then.

14:16.630 --> 14:17.240
Be careful on the road.

14:17.320 --> 14:17.840
Stay safe.

14:18.200 --> 14:18.750
Rest assured.

14:29.870 --> 14:30.670
You're back?

14:31.360 --> 14:32.150
Mr. Sun?

14:33.350 --> 14:34.120
What brings you here?

14:34.360 --> 14:35.120
I'm here to talk with you

14:35.480 --> 14:36.240
about something.

14:36.840 --> 14:37.600
What is it?

14:37.750 --> 14:38.550
Fenghua.

14:39.600 --> 14:40.960
Lychees from Guangdong.

14:41.600 --> 14:42.870
The three of us can't finish them all.

14:43.870 --> 14:44.630
You two carry on.

14:49.600 --> 14:52.230
Are you collaborating with Mr. Xie?

14:52.960 --> 14:54.750
He's in food delivery. I'm in parcel delivery.

14:55.080 --> 14:56.320
We're more like competitors.

14:56.320 --> 14:57.360
How could we possibly collaborate?

15:01.870 --> 15:02.440
Oh, right.

15:02.630 --> 15:03.480
I heard that

15:03.630 --> 15:04.630
recently,

15:04.630 --> 15:05.950
a lot of your people have left.

15:06.360 --> 15:07.360
How are you holding up?

15:10.480 --> 15:11.360
Fine.

15:11.840 --> 15:13.840
I've been trying to hire new people.

15:14.750 --> 15:15.910
Food delivery is really popular lately.

15:16.070 --> 15:16.840
It pays well too.

15:17.120 --> 15:17.840
It's not easy.

15:18.350 --> 15:19.840
If you're overwhelmed,

15:21.200 --> 15:22.600
you could consider giving that area

15:22.960 --> 15:23.840
to someone else.

15:26.080 --> 15:26.870
What do you mean?

15:28.360 --> 15:29.480
You want to cut in on my business?

15:29.600 --> 15:31.000
Aren't you overloaded?

15:32.080 --> 15:33.080
I'm trying

15:34.480 --> 15:35.920
to share your burden.

15:36.480 --> 15:38.480
After all, we're colleagues.

15:38.600 --> 15:41.600
Is this your idea or headquarters'?

15:43.480 --> 15:44.200
I think

15:44.360 --> 15:46.000
we can come up with a plan together first

15:46.000 --> 15:47.600
before I report it to headquarters.

15:47.600 --> 15:48.390
No need for that.

15:49.840 --> 15:50.840
We're doing well here.

15:51.000 --> 15:52.000
We don't need anyone's help.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.120
Don't be so stubborn.

15:56.390 --> 15:58.000
How many people did you have before?

15:58.360 --> 16:00.550
How many do you have now?

16:05.840 --> 16:07.360
If you can't complete

16:07.360 --> 16:08.360
the assigned tasks,

16:09.840 --> 16:11.440
everyone here will be doomed.

16:11.960 --> 16:13.600
Don't worry about that.

16:14.600 --> 16:16.070
I am shorthanded,

16:16.070 --> 16:17.550
but I can still get things done.

16:17.870 --> 16:19.550
When I do feel overwhelmed,

16:19.840 --> 16:21.320
I'll ask headquarters for help.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.630
By then, it'd be too late.

16:25.120 --> 16:26.750
The market nowadays

16:27.600 --> 16:28.720
is so competitive.

16:33.840 --> 16:34.600
Mr. Sun.

16:35.840 --> 16:37.840
I've always respected you as a senior

16:38.120 --> 16:40.240
and listened when you had something to say.

16:40.750 --> 16:42.240
For me,

16:42.360 --> 16:44.120
this is a matter of survival.

16:44.360 --> 16:45.440
If you won't help me,

16:45.600 --> 16:47.550
at least don't stab me in the back.

16:50.600 --> 16:52.840
You're too stubborn.

16:54.600 --> 16:55.440
Xia.

16:55.720 --> 16:57.000
Don't be impulsive.

16:57.120 --> 16:58.240
Think it through.

16:58.840 --> 16:59.840
In this era,

16:59.960 --> 17:01.120
changes happen so fast.

17:01.870 --> 17:02.790
If you miss an opportunity,

17:03.120 --> 17:04.109
it's lost for good.

17:05.240 --> 17:06.349
Think about it carefully.

17:16.480 --> 17:17.750
He came to cut in on your business, right?

17:20.829 --> 17:22.349
He thinks he has seniority

17:22.829 --> 17:24.000
and once snatched orders from me.

17:24.829 --> 17:25.960
Seeing I'm short-staffed now,

17:25.960 --> 17:27.030
he wants to take advantage of it again.

17:27.349 --> 17:28.680
But I won't give him that satisfaction.

17:29.830 --> 17:31.070
So you're just going to tough it out?

17:31.720 --> 17:32.920
You won't ask for help

17:33.480 --> 17:34.590
even if you're overloaded?

17:36.830 --> 17:38.440
I'll find a way to recruit people.

17:39.350 --> 17:40.110
How?

17:41.350 --> 17:42.110
By stealing my men?

17:42.750 --> 17:44.000
Are you able to do that?

17:50.830 --> 17:51.830
I'm not able to do that.

17:53.350 --> 17:54.640
So what do you suggest I do?

17:55.240 --> 17:57.310
I've thought of every possible solution.

17:57.590 --> 17:59.350
But any able-bodied man

17:59.350 --> 18:00.720
works in food delivery now.

18:20.830 --> 18:21.880
You can hire temps.

18:22.590 --> 18:23.720
Let them sort the packages

18:24.240 --> 18:26.310
so the couriers can have more time to deliver.

18:28.350 --> 18:30.120
Wouldn't that cost a lot?

18:30.590 --> 18:33.400
Hourly workers in Haidian don't work full days.

18:33.590 --> 18:35.640
Part-time shifts would be even cheaper.

18:41.070 --> 18:41.960
Is it easy to manage them?

18:42.350 --> 18:43.110
Spend some money

18:43.350 --> 18:45.590
and have Haikuo write you a part-time shift management software.

18:45.790 --> 18:46.830
It's simple and quick.

18:51.960 --> 18:52.720
Okay.

18:53.480 --> 18:54.400
I'll think about it.

18:56.000 --> 18:57.350
Take your time. No rush.

19:03.240 --> 19:04.030
Is it sweet?

19:05.400 --> 19:06.160
Yes.

19:08.760 --> 19:10.440
Finish them before they go bad.

19:29.000 --> 19:29.750
Fenghua.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.270
You're back so late.

19:31.310 --> 19:32.240
Let me heat up some food for you.

19:32.240 --> 19:34.480
It's okay. I'm not hungry. I'll make another delivery.

19:36.240 --> 19:38.480
Before food delivery was a thing,

19:38.480 --> 19:40.160
it was so easy to hire people.

19:40.160 --> 19:42.880
Just put up a sign, and people would come in droves.

19:43.720 --> 19:45.400
Every industry has its own challenges.

19:46.790 --> 19:48.880
Remember those first few years when we had to fight

19:49.240 --> 19:51.000
to keep our territory?

19:52.030 --> 19:53.550
I'll never forget that!

19:53.790 --> 19:55.350
You were a young girl

19:55.640 --> 19:57.550
but led dozens of people to argue with them.

19:58.240 --> 19:59.680
They hit your head with a shovel.

19:59.720 --> 20:01.640
Your scalp was turned inside out.

20:01.960 --> 20:02.920
Luckily, it didn't leave a scar on your face.

20:02.960 --> 20:04.960
I was scared to death at the time.

20:06.030 --> 20:06.960
Later,

20:07.550 --> 20:08.920
when you got stitches,

20:09.310 --> 20:10.510
you were actually smiling.

20:13.030 --> 20:16.030
As the leader, I couldn't cry.

20:16.030 --> 20:18.030
If I had cried, everyone else would've panicked.

20:19.790 --> 20:21.790
We're lucky to have had you all these years.

20:22.480 --> 20:24.160
You're the backbone for everyone.

20:24.160 --> 20:25.590
Only you can keep us together.

20:27.200 --> 20:29.030
Don't worry. Even if this station

20:29.240 --> 20:30.480
were to disband,

20:31.310 --> 20:33.920
I'd definitely be the last one to leave.

20:38.960 --> 20:39.750
Oh, by the way, Auntie,

20:39.790 --> 20:42.350
do you know any domestic workers?

20:43.960 --> 20:44.720
Plenty.

20:46.790 --> 20:48.720
Are you thinking about hiring hourly workers?

20:51.070 --> 20:52.310
Just tell me your requirements.

20:52.310 --> 20:53.400
I can introduce a lot of people to you.

20:53.720 --> 20:54.790
Also,

20:55.680 --> 20:57.310
would you consider someone not so young?

20:57.480 --> 20:58.480
Sure.

20:58.480 --> 21:01.440
Anyone who's diligent will do. The more, the better.

21:02.160 --> 21:04.160
Okay, I'll go call them now.

21:04.160 --> 21:05.270
I'll go now.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.960
You're even more eager than I am.

21:27.920 --> 21:28.400
Master,

21:28.640 --> 21:29.830
we're leaving.

21:30.790 --> 21:31.440
Everything's done?

21:32.310 --> 21:33.110
Alright, go home.

21:33.320 --> 21:33.590
Okay.

21:33.790 --> 21:35.030
Alright, we're leaving, Master.

21:35.070 --> 21:35.440
Go ahead.

21:35.480 --> 21:36.070
We're leaving.

21:36.200 --> 21:36.790
-Okay.
-Bye.

21:38.310 --> 21:39.070
Goodbye, Master.

21:39.960 --> 21:40.640
Go home.

21:40.960 --> 21:42.070
Don't play cards tonight.

21:42.320 --> 21:42.920
Okay.

22:03.750 --> 22:04.510
Everyone,

22:05.200 --> 22:07.310
I'll get straight to the point.

22:08.070 --> 22:09.110
Mr. Zhou

22:09.430 --> 22:12.070
was diagnosed with Alzheimer's disease a couple of days ago.

22:12.790 --> 22:14.310
I gathered everyone here today

22:14.790 --> 22:16.070
to inform you all about this

22:16.070 --> 22:17.720
so that you can be prepared.

22:17.790 --> 22:19.070
H-Has it been confirmed?

22:21.030 --> 22:21.840
This disease…

22:23.550 --> 22:24.920
is not easy to treat, is it?

22:26.000 --> 22:27.200
Well, people with this disease

22:27.830 --> 22:30.200
will gradually forget the people

22:30.440 --> 22:31.480
around them.

22:31.550 --> 22:32.550
In the most severe cases,

22:32.550 --> 22:34.590
they will even forget their families.

22:35.000 --> 22:37.310
So we all need to be mentally prepared.

22:37.790 --> 22:38.480
You mean,

22:39.310 --> 22:40.350
he'll forget

22:40.440 --> 22:41.000
all of us?

22:41.070 --> 22:42.960
That's why we need to take this seriously.

22:43.240 --> 22:45.070
If Mr. Zhou has a memory lapse one day,

22:45.070 --> 22:46.790
we all need to stay calm.

22:47.070 --> 22:48.200
We should play along

22:48.440 --> 22:49.790
and not let him sense anything unusual.

22:51.470 --> 22:54.000
But we don't know when he's normal

22:54.000 --> 22:55.920
and when he's having a memory lapse.

22:58.280 --> 23:00.550
I'll ask my friend working at the hospital about it.

23:01.070 --> 23:02.640
We should observe a patient

23:02.720 --> 23:05.550
to understand what this disease is really like.

23:05.550 --> 23:06.880
Then we'll know how to handle it.

23:06.960 --> 23:09.040
We need to know more about it, right?

23:09.470 --> 23:11.000
Now that Mr. Zhou is ill,

23:11.000 --> 23:13.640
can he still take care of his daily needs by himself?

23:13.640 --> 23:14.630
For now, he can.

23:14.630 --> 23:15.920
But we don't know about the future.

23:17.030 --> 23:17.790
Yeah.

23:18.000 --> 23:20.480
Then we need to get someone to watch him all day,

23:20.720 --> 23:21.750
don't we?

23:22.480 --> 23:23.630
We can't let him get lost.

23:23.630 --> 23:24.440
Watch him all day?

23:27.720 --> 23:28.720
Who can do that?

23:59.480 --> 24:01.000
How could this happen?

24:01.550 --> 24:03.070
W-We were just talking the other day

24:03.070 --> 24:04.070
about going to Italy together.

24:04.070 --> 24:05.670
I was just about to apply for a visa.

24:06.000 --> 24:07.270
Forget about Italy.

24:08.070 --> 24:10.200
It's too far. Forget about it.

24:12.310 --> 24:13.070
Chen Rui,

24:13.800 --> 24:14.790
I called you over

24:15.990 --> 24:17.310
to ask you for a favor.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.480
G-Go ahead.

24:18.480 --> 24:20.350
Just tell me what I can do to help.

24:22.440 --> 24:24.310
My dad doesn't know about his illness,

24:25.480 --> 24:26.920
and we don't want him to know.

24:27.640 --> 24:28.790
So,

24:29.480 --> 24:32.000
could you help me keep an eye on him?

24:32.310 --> 24:34.070
I'm worried he might get lost.

24:34.070 --> 24:36.750
No problem. We're together every day anyway.

24:36.960 --> 24:38.550
I'll keep an eye on him. Don't worry.

24:40.470 --> 24:41.480
Don't tell Haikuo

24:41.790 --> 24:42.560
about it.

24:43.830 --> 24:44.590
Why not?

24:46.000 --> 24:49.200
He's in Beijing and can't come back.

24:49.470 --> 24:50.480
It would just make him worry.

24:52.640 --> 24:53.440
That's true.

24:56.720 --> 24:57.270
Haikuo.

24:57.550 --> 24:58.350
Over here.

25:01.550 --> 25:02.350
What took you so long?

25:02.480 --> 25:03.310
I waited for you for ages.

25:03.310 --> 25:03.830
Mr. Zhou,

25:04.030 --> 25:04.680
pleasure to meet you.

25:04.750 --> 25:05.440
Welcome.

25:05.480 --> 25:05.830
Today,

25:05.830 --> 25:07.440
I'm going to show you three apartments.

25:07.550 --> 25:08.310
Take your time.

25:08.310 --> 25:08.830
You'll surely find a satisfying one.

25:08.830 --> 25:09.310
Let's go.

25:09.310 --> 25:09.880
Let's go.

25:12.240 --> 25:12.550
Mr. Zhou,

25:12.550 --> 25:13.550
please, this way.

25:13.750 --> 25:15.550
This is one of the best-selling new developments

25:15.550 --> 25:17.590
within the Fourth Ring Road.

25:17.590 --> 25:18.720
Take a look.

25:19.310 --> 25:20.640
This apartment is

25:20.640 --> 25:22.030
north-south facing with good ventilation.

25:22.030 --> 25:24.350
It has two bedrooms, two living rooms, and one bathroom.

25:24.550 --> 25:25.310
There's a lot of

25:25.310 --> 25:26.070
space.

25:26.070 --> 25:26.830
Look at this living room.

25:26.830 --> 25:28.160
It's 32 square meters in total.

25:28.160 --> 25:29.400
Mr. Zhou, take a look.

25:31.830 --> 25:32.550
Haikuo,

25:32.550 --> 25:33.110
come over.

25:33.110 --> 25:34.110
The view is great.

25:35.550 --> 25:36.350
Mr. Zhou?

25:38.270 --> 25:39.550
Are you not satisfied with this apartment?

25:39.750 --> 25:40.240
It's okay.

25:40.270 --> 25:40.830
I have other options for you.

25:40.830 --> 25:41.590
There's a 100-square-meter

25:41.590 --> 25:42.480
duplex.

25:42.480 --> 25:43.240
Let me show you.

25:45.200 --> 25:45.720
No need.

25:45.960 --> 25:46.550
Thank you.

25:46.960 --> 25:47.720
I'm busy today.

25:47.720 --> 25:48.640
Maybe next time.

25:49.000 --> 25:49.750
Let's go.

25:49.830 --> 25:51.200
Haikuo!

25:52.830 --> 25:53.590
Haikuo!

25:54.310 --> 25:55.880
Zhou Haikuo, what do you mean?

25:57.070 --> 25:58.200
I'm not planning to buy a house.

25:58.790 --> 25:59.480
Why not?

25:59.640 --> 26:01.000
I don't have money.

26:01.640 --> 26:02.550
Didn't Xie Wanghe say

26:02.550 --> 26:04.000
he would help you get stock options?

26:04.310 --> 26:06.400
I don't even know if the company will survive,

26:06.400 --> 26:07.640
so don't depend on the stock options.

26:07.790 --> 26:09.750
You think starting a business guarantees success?

26:09.790 --> 26:11.720
Then we can ask our parents for some money.

26:12.550 --> 26:13.590
I don't want to use my parents' money.

26:14.720 --> 26:15.920
Think about Mr. Du and Wenwen.

26:16.000 --> 26:17.000
Their parents paid the down payments for them,

26:17.000 --> 26:18.110
and then they'd pay off the mortgage themselves.

26:19.000 --> 26:19.750
In life,

26:20.310 --> 26:21.790
one should have a home of their own, right?

26:26.240 --> 26:28.000
Are you saying without a house, there's no home?

26:28.550 --> 26:30.400
I'm not asking for a big house.

26:30.790 --> 26:31.590
At least let me have

26:31.590 --> 26:32.920
a bedroom I can decorate myself.

26:32.920 --> 26:34.240
Even a small apartment would do.

26:34.550 --> 26:36.110
After we become rich…

26:36.110 --> 26:38.440
I'm very satisfied with the house I live in now.

26:39.240 --> 26:40.240
I don't want to change.

26:40.480 --> 26:40.830
Wait.

26:41.240 --> 26:43.070
Are you going to live in a rental house for the rest of your life?

26:43.070 --> 26:44.270
What's wrong with renting?

26:44.960 --> 26:46.200
Is life so unbearable in a rental house?

26:48.310 --> 26:49.120
Yes!

26:53.070 --> 26:54.200
Zhou Haikuo, if you leave now,

26:54.640 --> 26:56.270
don't ever come back to me!

26:59.750 --> 27:00.880
Enough.

27:01.270 --> 27:02.030
Stop drinking.

27:05.400 --> 27:06.750
Xiaohui isn't wrong.

27:07.440 --> 27:08.830
Having a house gives her peace of mind.

27:09.030 --> 27:09.960
My parents had a house.

27:10.480 --> 27:11.640
Did they have peace of mind?

27:12.030 --> 27:12.920
That's different.

27:13.200 --> 27:14.030
How is it different?

27:14.470 --> 27:15.310
In my opinion,

27:16.750 --> 27:17.440
a marriage certificate,

27:18.000 --> 27:18.510
a car,

27:18.510 --> 27:19.070
a house,

27:19.400 --> 27:20.030
and children—

27:20.640 --> 27:22.510
these things all seem to be the bonds of marriage

27:22.750 --> 27:24.680
that can make the relationship between two people stronger

27:24.720 --> 27:25.440
and more stable.

27:25.440 --> 27:27.880
But a truly unbreakable marriage

27:28.000 --> 27:29.480
doesn't need any of these things.

27:30.200 --> 27:32.000
Love alone is enough.

27:32.790 --> 27:35.310
Any relationship that needs external things to maintain

27:35.480 --> 27:37.400
is fragile

27:38.000 --> 27:39.270
and will fail sooner or later.

27:39.550 --> 27:40.960
My parents are a prime example.

27:41.240 --> 27:41.830
In my opinion,

27:42.310 --> 27:43.790
you just don't love Xiaohui enough.

27:44.310 --> 27:45.680
If you really loved Xiaohui,

27:45.720 --> 27:46.310
you'd not just give her a house

27:46.310 --> 27:47.070
but also your life.

27:47.310 --> 27:48.750
Shut up!

27:49.750 --> 27:50.720
Let me put it this way.

27:51.310 --> 27:52.670
If Xiaohui got sick

27:52.720 --> 27:53.990
and needed a kidney, would you give her yours?

27:53.990 --> 27:54.720
Of course.

27:54.760 --> 27:55.480
That's it.

27:55.550 --> 27:56.310
You'd give her a kidney

27:56.310 --> 27:56.880
but not a house?

27:57.000 --> 27:58.070
Are you crazy?

28:00.550 --> 28:02.480
You're the one who's crazy.

28:04.070 --> 28:05.080
I can understand that.

28:06.550 --> 28:07.200
Giving her his kidney

28:08.070 --> 28:09.400
means Haikuo loves her.

28:09.830 --> 28:11.070
It shows he cares for her.

28:11.750 --> 28:12.790
But being forced

28:13.640 --> 28:15.000
to buy her a house

28:15.240 --> 28:17.310
makes you feel like she doesn't trust you.

28:18.240 --> 28:19.240
It almost feels like

28:19.480 --> 28:20.000
she doesn't love you.

28:21.070 --> 28:21.750
That's it!

28:23.830 --> 28:24.400
I love her.

28:24.640 --> 28:26.200
I want to give her

28:26.240 --> 28:27.240
a better life,

28:27.240 --> 28:29.310
and I'll work hard for that.

28:29.720 --> 28:31.030
But she can't force me!

28:31.310 --> 28:32.310
It makes me feel that

28:32.830 --> 28:33.880
our relationship

28:33.880 --> 28:35.960
is bought with this house

28:36.270 --> 28:37.550
and it's fragile.

28:37.550 --> 28:38.240
Understand?

28:38.240 --> 28:38.680
Fine.

28:39.920 --> 28:41.000
If you really break up with her,

28:41.000 --> 28:41.680
don't come crying to us.

28:43.750 --> 28:44.510
I'll change the locks.

28:44.510 --> 28:45.790
Go cry to Xiaohui.

28:47.750 --> 28:48.430
Alright.

28:48.510 --> 28:49.110
You two drink.

28:49.480 --> 28:50.160
I'm leaving.

28:53.000 --> 28:53.750
I'm leaving!

28:56.920 --> 28:57.480
Go ahead.

28:58.000 --> 28:58.750
I'll talk to the river.

28:59.750 --> 29:00.590
I'm really leaving!

29:00.590 --> 29:01.160
Take care.

29:01.160 --> 29:01.880
Go ahead and jump.

29:01.880 --> 29:02.880
You're not stopping me?

29:02.880 --> 29:03.680
Jump.

29:08.240 --> 29:09.000
What are you going to do?

29:09.240 --> 29:09.750
Dance!

29:24.750 --> 29:25.320
Come here!

29:25.680 --> 29:26.480
Come here!

29:27.240 --> 29:27.920
Hurry up!

29:41.160 --> 29:41.750
Not bad.

29:43.320 --> 29:44.110
Your response

29:44.310 --> 29:45.590
is faster than I expected.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.920
You're young and full of energy.

29:49.240 --> 29:51.070
Yuntuan will catch up soon.

29:51.510 --> 29:52.640
Then surpass them again.

29:53.070 --> 29:54.920
Competition is all about spirit.

29:56.680 --> 29:58.160
We need more people.

29:58.800 --> 30:00.920
Yuntuan's HR department alone

30:00.990 --> 30:02.000
takes up half a floor.

30:02.960 --> 30:04.070
I know it's been hard for you.

30:04.480 --> 30:05.070
Hang in there.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.880
I've already started reaching out for Series D funding.

30:07.030 --> 30:07.720
Which company?

30:08.160 --> 30:08.920
I can't tell you for now.

30:09.920 --> 30:11.200
I'll let you know when it's done.

30:17.400 --> 30:18.160
Mr. Meng.

30:19.870 --> 30:20.640
Well…

30:21.920 --> 30:22.680
What's it?

30:24.350 --> 30:25.750
If we get the funding,

30:26.200 --> 30:27.200
before Series E,

30:27.640 --> 30:29.350
can you give my two friends

30:29.440 --> 30:30.480
some stock options?

30:31.590 --> 30:32.590
The amount doesn't matter.

30:32.590 --> 30:34.160
The gesture itself matters.

30:34.480 --> 30:36.350
I hope Bee can make them

30:36.400 --> 30:38.000
feel included.

30:43.590 --> 30:47.400
So without stock options, they don't feel included?

30:47.400 --> 30:48.590
Not exactly...

30:48.590 --> 30:50.350
In the whole company,

30:50.480 --> 30:51.750
how many people actually have stock options?

30:57.960 --> 30:59.590
I can share mine with them.

31:00.400 --> 31:01.440
Just don't tell them.

31:05.960 --> 31:06.750
You're close friends.

31:07.960 --> 31:09.480
After you succeed,

31:09.480 --> 31:10.960
buy them a nice car.

31:11.480 --> 31:12.240
That'll be enough.

31:13.110 --> 31:14.640
I'm not teaching you to be stingy.

31:16.110 --> 31:17.000
It's just that

31:17.510 --> 31:18.640
people are unpredictable.

31:19.350 --> 31:20.590
Great kindness can lead to resentment.

31:22.110 --> 31:22.960
Look at me.

31:23.680 --> 31:25.270
I started my business in college.

31:25.950 --> 31:27.510
And today, none of my old friends

31:29.400 --> 31:30.230
are still around.

31:30.590 --> 31:32.430
It's a hard-learned lesson.

31:33.240 --> 31:34.110
We're different.

31:34.750 --> 31:35.550
We're childhood friends.

31:35.680 --> 31:36.720
We were neighbors.

31:36.830 --> 31:37.830
So what?

31:38.680 --> 31:39.670
Even blood brothers

31:39.960 --> 31:40.790
fight tooth and nail

31:40.960 --> 31:43.000
over a bit of inheritance.

31:43.720 --> 31:44.240
And think about

31:44.240 --> 31:46.070
those successful big companies.

31:46.960 --> 31:47.960
How many can you name

31:48.200 --> 31:50.000
that are still owned by their founding members?

31:50.680 --> 31:51.440
Naive.

32:08.160 --> 32:08.830
Son.

32:10.350 --> 32:10.640
Mom?

32:10.640 --> 32:11.350
Get in.

32:20.240 --> 32:21.270
What are you doing here?

32:21.830 --> 32:22.830
Let's go have dinner.

32:40.440 --> 32:41.830
The head chef of this restaurant

32:41.920 --> 32:43.160
was your father's apprentice.

32:43.400 --> 32:45.000
The restaurant's owner poached him with a high salary.

32:45.160 --> 32:47.000
Try it and see if it tastes the same.

32:49.000 --> 32:49.510
Not bad.

32:51.000 --> 32:52.200
I'll give you a card later.

32:52.440 --> 32:53.830
Bring Wanghe and the others here to eat.

32:55.720 --> 32:56.790
How's your dad doing lately?

32:59.470 --> 33:00.920
Don't you two call each other?

33:03.350 --> 33:04.400
We haven't been in touch for a long time.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.480
We're both busy.

33:08.350 --> 33:10.680
I occasionally call your grandpa to check on things,

33:11.110 --> 33:12.680
but he only shares good news with me.

33:13.190 --> 33:14.720
Because there's no bad news.

33:15.960 --> 33:16.790
You're the same.

33:17.000 --> 33:19.160
Every time I ask, you say everything's fine.

33:19.400 --> 33:20.400
You won't tell me anything.

33:21.350 --> 33:22.960
It's true that everything's fine,

33:22.960 --> 33:24.280
or I would definitely tell you.

33:25.960 --> 33:27.270
What about you and Xiaohui?

33:30.680 --> 33:31.880
Why did you two fight if everything was fine?

33:38.590 --> 33:39.480
She went to you?

33:39.720 --> 33:40.240
Yes.

33:40.680 --> 33:41.480
She kept crying.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.310
It's your fault.

33:44.480 --> 33:46.720
Why make such a fuss over a house?

33:46.960 --> 33:47.880
As a girl,

33:47.920 --> 33:49.920
she needs to feel secure.

33:50.590 --> 33:52.110
You hurt her feelings.

33:52.680 --> 33:54.000
Can a house

33:55.830 --> 33:56.960
really make her feel secure?

33:57.350 --> 33:58.200
Of course.

33:58.200 --> 34:00.110
Having a house means having a home.

34:01.830 --> 34:04.960
But you and Dad had a house and a home.

34:08.949 --> 34:09.960
At your age,

34:09.960 --> 34:11.440
you should be past your rebellious phase.

34:11.590 --> 34:13.070
This is your problem.

34:13.840 --> 34:15.360
Don't bring up your dad and me.

34:16.960 --> 34:18.190
We had a house.

34:19.110 --> 34:20.360
Life was not bad.

34:20.960 --> 34:22.710
My dad is down-to-earth.

34:24.480 --> 34:26.480
I believe you didn't feel insecure.

34:26.590 --> 34:26.960
No.

34:27.190 --> 34:27.880
I didn't feel insecure.

34:30.110 --> 34:31.190
But you still left.

34:33.960 --> 34:35.590
So, a sense of security

34:35.630 --> 34:37.230
is not important for marriage,

34:38.360 --> 34:39.440
and it's not a necessity.

34:40.880 --> 34:41.840
You felt secure,

34:42.710 --> 34:45.360
yet you still found the mundane life boring.

34:45.480 --> 34:46.590
So why should I pursue

34:46.590 --> 34:47.710
the so-called sense of security?

34:56.840 --> 34:57.960
Sorry, Son.

34:58.190 --> 34:59.510
What happened between your dad and me

35:00.230 --> 35:02.840
traumatized you.

35:04.190 --> 35:05.760
That's not what I mean.

35:09.840 --> 35:11.000
When you were young,

35:11.400 --> 35:13.110
there were things you wouldn't understand even if I told you.

35:13.400 --> 35:14.670
Now that you've grown up,

35:14.880 --> 35:16.070
I can tell you about them.

35:17.630 --> 35:20.440
I've only loved one man in my entire life.

35:21.000 --> 35:22.000
That's your dad.

35:22.670 --> 35:23.670
I still love him.

35:26.480 --> 35:27.440
But

35:28.190 --> 35:29.550
the life he gave me…

35:30.960 --> 35:33.280
made me feel depressed and suffocated.

35:33.840 --> 35:36.960
I'd rather face all kinds of hardships outside

35:37.360 --> 35:40.590
than go back to that unchanging life

35:41.160 --> 35:42.910
where I could see how it would end.

35:46.960 --> 35:47.760
So,

35:48.950 --> 35:51.280
your dad and I parted on good terms.

35:52.230 --> 35:53.800
We both have resentment in our hearts,

35:54.590 --> 35:55.670
but we also wish each other well.

35:58.000 --> 36:01.030
Are you sure Dad wishes you well?

36:01.440 --> 36:02.480
Of course!

36:02.550 --> 36:03.710
He loves me very much too.

36:03.960 --> 36:05.960
That's why he let me go.

36:10.920 --> 36:11.960
As for you and Xiaohui,

36:12.150 --> 36:13.880
I don't care about what will happen in the future.

36:14.110 --> 36:15.670
If you truly love her,

36:16.000 --> 36:18.190
I hope you think through a few things.

36:19.710 --> 36:20.110
First,

36:20.440 --> 36:22.550
can you give her the life she wants?

36:23.400 --> 36:23.960
Second,

36:24.480 --> 36:25.670
will that kind of life

36:26.360 --> 36:28.230
make you miserable?

36:29.360 --> 36:30.760
Third and most importantly,

36:31.430 --> 36:32.230
after breaking up with her,

36:33.230 --> 36:34.960
will you regret it?

36:40.280 --> 36:40.960
How about you?

36:41.440 --> 36:42.150
Do you regret it?

36:47.360 --> 36:49.760
I know what my answer is.

36:50.630 --> 36:52.550
You need to figure out what your answer is.

36:53.230 --> 36:55.960
Everyone is responsible for their own life.

36:56.710 --> 36:59.800
Neither your dad nor I have the right to make choices for you.

37:52.070 --> 37:52.800
Tonight,

37:54.110 --> 37:54.880
my mom and I

37:56.150 --> 37:57.000
ate this.

38:07.670 --> 38:08.230
Sorry.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.230
All right.

38:11.840 --> 38:12.670
I won't leave.

38:13.320 --> 38:13.920
Don't worry.

38:17.000 --> 38:17.920
Stop crying.

38:36.550 --> 38:37.480
I wonder

38:38.150 --> 38:39.710
if he'll break up with Xiaohui.

38:40.760 --> 38:41.590
It won't come to that.

38:42.670 --> 38:43.550
How do you know?

38:43.670 --> 38:45.320
Xiaohui loves him so much.

38:45.550 --> 38:47.150
He didn't reply to her messages for a few days,

38:47.400 --> 38:48.710
and her eyes were swollen from crying.

38:49.030 --> 38:50.840
She dragged me to meet Haikuo's mom with her.

38:51.270 --> 38:52.320
She was so humble.

38:56.670 --> 38:58.280
If you were her,

38:58.800 --> 38:59.800
what would you do?

39:00.030 --> 39:01.030
You mean the house?

39:02.550 --> 39:03.840
What kind of house do you want?

39:06.070 --> 39:06.880
I don't want

39:07.480 --> 39:08.190
a house

39:08.480 --> 39:09.280
but an RV.

39:10.070 --> 39:12.280
The kind you can drive around everywhere.

39:13.000 --> 39:14.030
When I've earned enough money,

39:14.280 --> 39:15.360
I'll drive my RV

39:15.480 --> 39:17.030
to travel all over the world.

39:17.760 --> 39:18.510
Wherever I go,

39:18.960 --> 39:19.760
I'll set up a tent,

39:19.960 --> 39:20.760
build a fire,

39:21.000 --> 39:21.840
grill some skewers,

39:21.960 --> 39:22.670
and open a beer.

39:23.000 --> 39:23.480
Perfect.

39:25.030 --> 39:25.760
Where do you want to go the most?

39:26.070 --> 39:27.030
The place doesn't matter.

39:27.840 --> 39:29.670
What matters is who I travel with.

39:33.230 --> 39:33.840
Yes.

39:37.230 --> 39:38.040
What about you?

39:38.880 --> 39:40.070
If the company goes public

39:40.110 --> 39:41.150
and you achieve financial freedom,

39:41.590 --> 39:42.880
how do you plan to live your life?

39:44.590 --> 39:47.190
Travel with the girl I love.

39:50.320 --> 39:51.840
That's my dream.

39:51.880 --> 39:52.840
What about your own dream?

39:53.190 --> 39:55.000
Dreams can overlap, you know.

39:55.510 --> 39:56.710
If I were to travel,

39:57.510 --> 39:58.840
I'd sail a ship

39:58.880 --> 40:00.230
along the canal to leave the country,

40:00.960 --> 40:03.280
cruising along the coastline.

40:04.880 --> 40:06.190
Greece is by the sea, right?

40:06.670 --> 40:07.480
Yes.

40:08.880 --> 40:11.400
Then I'll take wedding photos by the Aegean Sea.

40:11.550 --> 40:12.880
They must look great.

40:13.070 --> 40:13.880
Wedding photos?

40:15.960 --> 40:16.760
With whom?

40:18.760 --> 40:19.840
Certainly not with you.

40:22.710 --> 40:23.960
You don't know that.

40:26.670 --> 40:27.840
I said the shrimp is good.

40:29.000 --> 40:29.670
Trust me.

40:29.950 --> 40:30.800
This restaurant is great.

40:31.030 --> 40:31.880
Welcome.

40:32.280 --> 40:33.230
Let's drink tonight.

40:36.070 --> 40:36.590
Go in.

40:36.710 --> 40:37.200
Wait, wait.

40:37.200 --> 40:37.710
Sorry.

40:38.190 --> 40:39.760
I-I made a mistake.

40:40.030 --> 40:40.840
It's not this restaurant.

40:41.190 --> 40:42.760
The shrimps here are very small.

40:43.400 --> 40:44.630
Let me take you somewhere else.

40:50.960 --> 40:51.760
Bye.

40:54.430 --> 40:55.000
Fenghua.

40:55.880 --> 40:57.230
Are you still using that plaster?

40:58.270 --> 40:59.110
Yes.

40:59.670 --> 41:00.760
My lower back hasn't been hurting much lately.

41:01.920 --> 41:03.190
Avoid heavy lifting.

41:03.870 --> 41:04.510
Don't stay up late.

41:04.630 --> 41:05.760
Eat meals on time.

41:06.400 --> 41:07.190
Brush your teeth with warm water.

41:07.400 --> 41:08.920
The foot bath water should be hot. You hear me?

41:09.670 --> 41:11.710
I got it. You nag even more than my mom.

41:12.280 --> 41:13.070
Bye.

41:14.230 --> 41:14.760
Well,

41:14.880 --> 41:15.840
wait for me a moment.

41:26.230 --> 41:27.000
Here, this is for you.

41:27.030 --> 41:27.760
What is it?

41:28.280 --> 41:29.560
Read it, and you'll know.

41:30.760 --> 41:34.400
"Guide for Reducing Costs and Increasing Efficiency of Delivery Riders in Haidian District."

41:41.320 --> 41:42.070
Xia Fenghua,

41:44.600 --> 41:46.440
I sincerely invite you again

41:47.230 --> 41:48.110
to join Bee.

41:51.150 --> 41:52.150
Not interested.

41:52.590 --> 41:53.630
Why not?

41:53.840 --> 41:55.590
When I took over this station,

41:56.280 --> 41:57.590
it was almost going under.

41:59.110 --> 42:01.190
At that time, we were all at a loss,

42:01.720 --> 42:03.230
not knowing what the future held.

42:04.150 --> 42:05.840
People were leaving every day.

42:06.070 --> 42:08.640
At the toughest time, only four people were left.

42:09.110 --> 42:10.630
We didn't know where the next meal would come from.

42:11.800 --> 42:13.070
I was really scared.

42:13.670 --> 42:15.760
So I secretly set a goal for myself:

42:16.150 --> 42:17.200
within three years,

42:17.200 --> 42:19.110
I would not only keep this station running

42:19.320 --> 42:21.360
but also make sure everyone earned money,

42:21.710 --> 42:24.440
and I'd be the station chief of the year.

42:24.840 --> 42:27.110
That goal hasn't been achieved yet.

42:27.710 --> 42:28.830
I can't give up now.

42:29.270 --> 42:30.360
Compared to them,

42:31.710 --> 42:33.110
I need you more.

42:34.760 --> 42:35.670
Wanghe,

42:36.440 --> 42:37.880
I know you care about me

42:38.440 --> 42:39.280
and don't want me to push myself too hard.

42:40.320 --> 42:41.440
But it's okay.

42:41.510 --> 42:42.760
I'm quite happy.

42:43.670 --> 42:44.760
Being needed

42:44.760 --> 42:46.360
makes me feel powerful.

42:48.000 --> 42:49.630
All these years in Beijing,

42:50.320 --> 42:51.760
I've been like a wild grass,

42:51.760 --> 42:53.000
struggling to survive.

42:54.360 --> 42:55.440
Making it to today,

42:56.190 --> 42:57.320
I feel like

42:57.710 --> 42:59.110
I'm finally about to bloom.
